abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for a multilingual computational media-framing study
  of generative AI discourse in health, misinformation, trust, and regulation.
  The release contains frozen protocols, public analysis code, aggregate
  development and held-out results, representation diagnostics, and provenance
  records while excluding restricted source text and private annotation data.
